name: Report qualifies automatic TP decisions without changing stored authority or proof
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_supporting_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART initial
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 1 finding · 1 reviewed · TP: 1 | report-decisions
expect: Reviewed and TP totals include human and automatic decisions.
expect: Finding details show author and proof.
expect-not: 1 reviewed · 1 confirmed
resize: 160x48
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 TP: 1 | report-40x12
keys: PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 automatic | authority-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: allowance-40x12
ask: Is the headline readable at every size, with automatic decisions and separate proof understandable through visible paging at 40x12?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 6 committed / 6 calls | exhausted-report
expect: 0 protected review remaining
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_supporting_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART exported
keys: s
require-live-snap: 25 History · current source unassessed | history-report
expect: Reviewed and TP totals include human and automatic decisions.
expect: TP: 1
ask: Does the authority guidance remain clear for both the selected study and workspace history, without turning a model opinion into human confirmation or runtime proof?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 TP: 1 | recovered-report
expect: Reviewed and TP totals include human and automatic decisions.
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_supporting_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
